      "default": 0,
      "description": "Rows in fueltype."
    },
    "n_outputRefuelRow": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 168,
      "description": "THE ONE DECLARED NUMBER IN THIS DOCUMENT: how many (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs reach MOVESOutput, before the day axis. 64 for Refueling Displacement Vapor Loss and 104 for Refueling Spillage Loss -- the two blocks are DIFFERENT sizes, which is why one rank runs across the whole rate relation rather than a per-block cohort count. WHICH 168 is a result of the chain and is never written down: `rt_refuelRank` numbers them by an inclusive prefix count over the rate relation and the output row joins to that rank (docs/esm-conventions.md 22). `run_refuelRowCount` recomputes 168 and `pp_refuelRowCount` recomputes the 64 and the 104 separately."
    }
  },
