          "description": "zonemonthhour.temperature, 59.5 degF at hour 7. The temperature adjustment reads THIS column and the A/C activity term and the EV suppression read `heatIndex`; the two are equal in every row of this snapshot, so the distinction costs nothing here and is made because adjust.rs:495-535 makes it.",
