          "description": "Whether the exact-class row exists. It does not here, and MIXED-ONROAD SILENTLY DEPENDED ON THAT: with only the exact lookup its EV temperature terms came out 0, its raw adjustment 0 instead of -0.00419, and the clamp returned the same 1 for the wrong reason. At 59.5 degF the raw adjustment is +0.015625 and does not clamp, so the missing fallback would be a 1.56 % error on all 84 electricity rows -- and is how it was found."
        },
        "rt_tempAdjustTermAWildcard": {
