        {
          "id": "the_seven_pollutant_processes_and_the_two_roles_they_play",
          "description": "The run's whole pollutant scope, unpacked from `runspecpollutantprocess` rather than written down, and split into the two roles this calculator cares about. THREE are Total Energy Consumption -- 9101 running, 9102 start, 9190 extended idle -- and those are the rows the refueling formulae CONSUME: refueling_loss_calculator.rs's `mwo.pollutantID = 91 AND mwo.processID IN (1, 2, 90, 91)`. TWO are Total Gaseous Hydrocarbons on the refueling processes, 118 and 119, and those are the rows it PRODUCES. The remaining two are Total Organic Gases on the same two processes, and they must be neither: TOG is produced downstream by a speciation calculator chaining off this one's THC, so a document that keyed the refueling rate on the PROCESS alone would give 8618 and 8619 a rate as well and emit 336 spurious rows. `rspp_refuelingProcessID` is the intersection with THC that stops it, and it is 0 -- no process -- on all five non-refueling rows.\n\nThe unit divisor is the third column here and it is a measurement rather than a constant: S18 divides by 1,055,055.9 for pollutants 91, 92 and 93 and by exactly 1 otherwise, so the two emitted blocks carry 1 and the three energy rows beside them carry the constant, which is what makes the 1 a computed answer.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 86.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 86.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 91.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 5
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 91.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 6
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 91.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 7
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 18.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 19.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 18.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
